  Fn pair yes with n1 gives ${eq(yes, n1)} and ${ne(yes, n1)}.

  Fn pair no with n0 gives ${eq(no, n0)} and ${ne(no, n0)}.

  Fn pair yes with n5 gives ${eq(yes, n5)} and ${ne(yes, n5)}.

