  Fn pair bob with bob gives ${eq(bob, bob)} and ${ne(bob, bob)}.

  Fn pair ref with nothing gives ${eq(ref, nothing)} and ${ne(ref, nothing)}.

  Fn order n5 n9 gives ${lt(n5, n9)} ${ge(n5, n9)}.

  Fn order n9 n5 gives ${lt(n9, n5)} ${ge(n9, n5)}.

  Fn order n5 f5 gives ${lt(n5, f5)} ${ge(n5, f5)}.

