  Fn order sm2 n0 gives ${lt(sm2, n0)} ${ge(sm2, n0)}.

  Fn order n1000 s1e3 gives ${lt(n1000, s1e3)} ${ge(n1000, s1e3)}.

  Fn order h sdot5 gives ${lt(h, sdot5)} ${ge(h, sdot5)}.

  Fn n0 is ${truthy(n0)}, not ${negate(n0)}, and ${both(n0)}, or ${either(n0)}, ternary ${ternaryOf(n0)}.

  Fn n1 is ${truthy(n1)}, not ${negate(n1)}, and ${both(n1)}, or ${either(n1)}, ternary ${ternaryOf(n1)}.

  Fn nm2 is ${truthy(nm2)}, not ${negate(nm2)}, and ${both(nm2)}, or ${either(nm2)}, ternary ${ternaryOf(nm2)}.

  Fn h is ${truthy(h)}, not ${negate(h)}, and ${both(h)}, or ${either(h)}, ternary ${ternaryOf(h)}.

  Fn s0 is ${truthy(s0)}, not ${negate(s0)}, and ${both(s0)}, or ${either(s0)}, ternary ${ternaryOf(s0)}.

  Fn sempty is ${truthy(sempty)}, not ${negate(sempty)}, and ${both(sempty)}, or ${either(sempty)}, ternary ${ternaryOf(sempty)}.

  Fn sspace is ${truthy(sspace)}, not ${negate(sspace)}, and ${both(sspace)}, or ${either(sspace)}, ternary ${ternaryOf(sspace)}.

  Fn sfalse is ${truthy(sfalse)}, not ${negate(sfalse)}, and ${both(sfalse)}, or ${either(sfalse)}, ternary ${ternaryOf(sfalse)}.

  Fn yes is ${truthy(yes)}, not ${negate(yes)}, and ${both(yes)}, or ${either(yes)}, ternary ${ternaryOf(yes)}.

  Fn no is ${truthy(no)}, not ${negate(no)}, and ${both(no)}, or ${either(no)}, ternary ${ternaryOf(no)}.

  Fn nothing is ${truthy(nothing)}, not ${negate(nothing)}, and ${both(nothing)}, or ${either(nothing)}, ternary ${ternaryOf(nothing)}.

  Fn arr0 is ${truthy(arr0)}, not ${negate(arr0)}, and ${both(arr0)}, or ${either(arr0)}, ternary ${ternaryOf(arr0)}.

  Fn arr5 is ${truthy(arr5)}, not ${negate(arr5)}, and ${both(arr5)}, or ${either(arr5)}, ternary ${ternaryOf(arr5)}.

  Fn obj is ${truthy(obj)}, not ${negate(obj)}, and ${both(obj)}, or ${either(obj)}, ternary ${ternaryOf(obj)}.

  Fn ref is ${truthy(ref)}, not ${negate(ref)}, and ${both(ref)}, or ${either(ref)}, ternary ${ternaryOf(ref)}.

  Fn bob is ${truthy(bob)}, not ${negate(bob)}, and ${both(bob)}, or ${either(bob)}, ternary ${ternaryOf(bob)}.

  Switch n5 gives ${kind(n5)}.

  Switch f5 gives ${kind(f5)}.

  Switch s5 gives ${kind(s5)}.

  Switch s5sp gives ${kind(s5sp)}.

  Switch sabc gives ${kind(sabc)}.

  Switch yes gives ${kind(yes)}.

  Switch strue gives ${kind(strue)}.

  Switch n1 gives ${kind(n1)}.

  Switch no gives ${kind(no)}.

  Switch nothing gives ${kind(nothing)}.

  Countdown from 3 takes ${countdown(3)} steps, from 0 takes ${countdown(0)}.

  Literals give ${literal(0)} ${literal(1)} ${literal(2)} ${literal(3)} ${literal(4)} ${literal(5)}.

beat Helper
  Never played.

